## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design a streaming NLP system that handles multiple languages, domain adaptation, drift monitoring, latency budgets, and privacy considerations.

## Key Concepts

- Multilingual NER with adapters
- Drift monitoring and active learning
- Domain gazetteers and retrieval augmentation
- Privacy: data minimization and differential privacy
- Evaluation: streaming metrics, latency budgets, OOD checks

## Code Example

